{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000001041","bookName":"Camino mortal: La escolta prohibida (Doblado) ","cover":"","viewCount":18056597,"followCount":431904,"introduction":"La mejor agencia de escoltas recibe una misión: llevar al traidor Nerón a la capital para su ejecución. Pero la Secta Sombra ha jurado interceptar la misión, convirtiendo el viaje en una travesía llena de peligros. Para proteger el envío, los escoltas arriesgan sus vidas. Alonso Castro descubre que el peón Alejo es en realidad un legendario espadachín retirado y lo convence de ayudar en secreto. Gracias a él, logran derrotar a la Secta Sombra.","chapterCount":63,"labels":["Playing Dumb","Historical"],"tags":["Playing Dumb","Historical"],"typeTwoIds":[308],"typeTwoNames":["Identidad Secreta"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":308,"name":"Identidad Secreta","replaceName":"identidad-secreta"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Identidad-Secreta","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Camino-mortal-La-escolta-prohibida-Doblado","bookNameLower":"camino-mortal-la-escolta-prohibida-doblado","shelfTime":"2025-12-08 19:32:01","firstShelfTime":"2025-12-08 19:32:01","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700069018","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":235542,"price":0},{"id":"700069019","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":219358,"price":0},{"id":"700069020","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":194327,"price":0},{"id":"700069021","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":107693,"price":0},{"id":"700069022","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":161308,"price":0},{"id":"700069023","index":5,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":159335,"price":0},{"id":"700069024","index":6,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":115031,"price":0},{"id":"700069025","index":7,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":177725,"price":0},{"id":"700069026","index":8,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":128893,"price":0},{"id":"700069027","inde